  "ingredients": [
    "2 tablespoons olive oil",
    "2.5 teaspoons Italian seasoning",
    "2.5 teaspoons poultry seasoning",
    "2 teaspoons paprika",
    "2 teaspoons salt",
    "1 (5 pound) whole chicken, giblets removed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat an air fryer to 360 degrees F (180 degrees C) according to manufacturer's instructions.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PHvGn7mEbExhowhYj5q1Mq9DvBg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8453018-easy-air-fryer-whole-chicken-VAT-step-01-0ca1ee6e68da4a29860ebef3f4d6a5ac.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8453018/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk olive oil, Italian seasoning, poultry seasoning, paprika, and salt together in a small bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UXMm3EGx26xhzTqYMhJwI-_3DVc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8453018-easy-air-fryer-whole-chicken-VAT-step-02-c98c885014d5456f930289ac0958a90e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8453018/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pat chicken dry using paper towels. Brush spice mixture over entire chicken, including underneath the wings.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UblmwoED4-Z7SajKKqJigXRyfTA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8453018-easy-air-fryer-whole-chicken-VAT-step-03-b61f3b27b04d4e80bb3bb544c0a7b091.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8453018/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place chicken in the basket of the air fryer breast side down; cook, undisturbed, for 45 minutes. Carefully flip the chicken over using tongs; cook until an instant-read thermometer reads 165 degrees F (74 degrees C), about 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QgKL7TabbapudqU-KZrb6-vlnYo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8453018-easy-air-fryer-whole-chicken-VAT-step-04-bff7d908a2284799ac4a1210e9a55b99.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8453018/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove chicken to a cutting board; let rest for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YsAjlDeHRPTRkTbqUQGv6J4lc6g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8453018-easy-air-fryer-whole-chicken-VAT-step-05-7dc4a6080db84d1ea0d527272cbae119.jpg"
